       }
      ],
      "text": "⍉respiratory sinus arrhythmia"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " (⍉tied to breathing) = less common, USU in elderly pts, and more likely pathological (ex, Hdz, digoxin toxicity)"
     }
    ]
   },
